cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use rusted-garlic, please cite this software and the original GARLIC
  paper. rusted-garlic is an independent Rust reimplementation of GARLIC by
  Juan Caballero and Gwenlyn Glusman; the original authors are not involved in
  this project.
title: rusted-garlic
abstract: Generate realistic artificial DNA sequences (a Rust reimplementation of GARLIC).
type: software
authors:
